| T3  | 2024-01-12 | Shop C | Assets:Checking | -200.00 |
| T3  | 2024-01-12 | Shop C | Expenses:Milk   | 200.00  |
When report run : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Category   |
| From     | 2024-01-01 |
| To       | 2024-12-31 |
| Interval | Whole      |
Then report rows are : ReportRow
| Account         | Level | Amount | IsSubtotal |
| Expenses        | 0     | 510.00 | true       |
| Expenses:Apples | 1     | 10.00  | false      |
| Expenses:Milk   | 1     | 200.00 | false      |
| Expenses:Zoo    | 1     | 300.00 | false      |
