| From     | 2024-01-01  |
| To       | 2024-12-31  |
| Interval | Whole       |
| Detail   | HighestOnly |
Then report rows are : ReportRow
| Account                | Level | Amount   | IsSubtotal |
| Income                 | 0     | 42025.00 | true       |
