| Ref | Date       | Payee    | Account           | Amount  |
| T1  | 2024-03-02 | Amazon   | Liabilities:Visa  | -89.99  |
| T1  | 2024-03-02 | Amazon   | Expenses:Shopping | 89.99   |
| T2  | 2024-03-25 | Visa     | Liabilities:Visa  | 300.00  |
| T2  | 2024-03-25 | Visa     | Assets:Checking   | -300.00 |
| T3  | 2024-03-28 | Transfer | Assets:Checking   | -500.00 |
| T3  | 2024-03-28 | Transfer | Assets:Savings    | 500.00  |
When report run : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Category   |
| From     | 2024-01-01 |
| To       | 2024-12-31 |
| Interval | Whole      |
Then report rows are : ReportRow
| Account           | Level | Amount | IsSubtotal |
| Expenses          | 0     | 89.99  | true       |
| Expenses:Shopping | 1     | 89.99  | false      |
Then report total is : ReportTotal Vertical
