Description T2 credits Income:Invest Inc for 1200.00 and the money stayed in
Description the IRA, so the report shows only the 40.00 that reached the bank.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path              | Type       | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking   | Bank       | false       |
| Assets:Ken IRA    | Investment | false       |
| Income            | Income     | true        |
| Income:Invest Inc | Income     | false       |
| Income:Salary     | Income     | false       |
| Expenses          | Expense    | true        |
| Expenses:Fees     | Expense    | false       |
Given postings are : PostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Payee        | Account           | Amount   |
| T1  | 2024-03-01 | Acme Payroll | Assets:Checking   | 5000.00  |
| T1  | 2024-03-01 | Acme Payroll | Income:Salary     | -5000.00 |
| T2  | 2024-03-02 | Vanguard     | Assets:Ken IRA    | 1200.00  |
| T2  | 2024-03-02 | Vanguard     | Income:Invest Inc | -1200.00 |
| T3  | 2024-03-03 | First Bank   | Assets:Checking   | 40.00    |
| T3  | 2024-03-03 | First Bank   | Income:Invest Inc | -40.00   |
| T4  | 2024-03-04 | Vanguard     | Assets:Ken IRA    | -25.00   |
| T4  | 2024-03-04 | Vanguard     | Expenses:Fees     | 25.00    |
| T5  | 2024-03-05 | Vanguard     | Assets:Ken IRA    | -3000.00 |
| T5  | 2024-03-05 | Vanguard     | Assets:Checking   | 3000.00  |
When report run : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Category   |
| From     | 2024-01-01 |
