| T7  | 2024-05-05 | Quick Fit | Expenses:Auto:Repairs | 300.00 |
# The subtotal was 450.00 and these two postings are what made it. Opening a
# subtotal reaches through the placeholder to the leaves beneath it.

Attributes ReportCell
| Attribute | Type        | Default    |
| Account   | AccountPath |            |
| From      | Date        | 2024-01-01 |
| To        | Date        | 2024-12-31 |

Attributes DrillDownRow
| Attribute | Type           | Default    |
| Ref       | TransactionRef |            |
| Date      | Date           | 2024-01-01 |
| Payee     | PayeeName      | none       |
| Account   | AccountPath    |            |
| Amount    | Money          | 0.00       |

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Net worth over time
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Scenario Net worth at the end of each year
Description The real accounts only, as in Accounts. Each column is a balance as
Description at a date rather than a total of a period, which is why this report
Description is a different shape from the category one.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path             | Type       | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking  | Bank       | false       |
| Liabilities:Visa | CreditCard | false       |
| Income:Salary    | Income     | false       |
| Expenses:Shopping | Expense   | false       |
Given postings are : PostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Payee        | Account           | Amount    |
| T1  | 2023-06-30 | Acme Payroll | Assets:Checking   | 40000.00  |
| T1  | 2023-06-30 | Acme Payroll | Income:Salary     | -40000.00 |
| T2  | 2023-12-01 | Amazon       | Liabilities:Visa  | -500.00   |
| T2  | 2023-12-01 | Amazon       | Expenses:Shopping | 500.00    |
| T3  | 2024-06-30 | Acme Payroll | Assets:Checking   | 42000.00  |
| T3  | 2024-06-30 | Acme Payroll | Income:Salary     | -42000.00 |
When net worth report run : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Account    |
| From     | 2023-01-01 |
| To       | 2024-12-31 |
| Interval | Year       |
Then net worth columns are : NetWorthColumn
| AsAt       | Assets   | Liabilities | NetWorth |
| 2023-12-31 | 40000.00 | 500.00      | 39500.00 |
| 2024-12-31 | 82000.00 | 500.00      | 81500.00 |

Attributes NetWorthColumn
| Attribute   | Type  | Default    |
| AsAt        | Date  | 2024-12-31 |
| Assets      | Money | 0.00       |
| Liabilities | Money | 0.00       |
| NetWorth    | Money | 0.00       |

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Taking a report away
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Scenario A report is written out as CSV with its figures unrounded
Description The file is for a spreadsheet, so the grouping separators and the
Description parentheses of the displayed report are left out and the sign is
Description written as a minus.
Given the chart of accounts is as previous
Given postings are as previous
When report exported as csv : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Category   |
| From     | 2024-01-01 |
| To       | 2024-12-31 |
| Interval | Whole      |
Then csv written is
"""
Account,Level,Amount
Income,0,42025.00
Income:Interest,1,25.00
Income:Salary,1,42000.00
Expenses,0,960.00
Expenses:Auto,1,450.00
Expenses:Auto:Fuel,2,150.00
Expenses:Auto:Repairs,2,300.00
